      "v": 6,
      "zh": "「那时，这沿海一带的居民必说：『看哪，我们素所仰望的，就是我们为脱离亚述王逃往求救的，不过是如此！我们怎能逃脱呢？』」",
      "en": "At that time[NOTE:1] those who live on this coast[NOTE:2] will say, ‘Look what has happened to our source of hope to whom we fled for help, expecting to be rescued from the king of Assyria! How can we escape now?’”",
      "notes": [
